UID:3e11968921fb2e5673c53ed5844a966a5182026_11:28:09_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Grad School Tour of University of Rochester 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330188
DESCRIPTION:Transportation will be provided for this graduate school tour of the University of Rochester. Bus departs from in front of the SAU at 8:30am. Bus will return to RIT by 12pm. We will return to campus by 12pm and you can grab a boxed lunch, to go! This required event counts toward your research hours for the week. \n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330188
END:VEVENT
