SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Writing Workshop - Writing the Abstract
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328298
DESCRIPTION:This is a mandatory event. Breakfast is served at 9am, and program staff will be available for questions or any concerns from 9-9:30am. If you do not have questions, you are still welcome to arrive early. No one should arrive later than 9:15 am. The writing workshop will begin promptly at 9:30am with attendance taken first.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2328298
