UID:198e47c3abe181d53eb0ccd61ac518206152026_3:56:17_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Goodbye, Goodbuy! Summer Volunteering 2026
LOCATION:Lobby of Grace Watson Hall, 1 Lomb Memorial Dr, Rochester, NY 14623, United States
URL:https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330382
DESCRIPTION:Every year, Goodbye, Goodbuy! hosts summer volunteering to sort donations, clean and test electronics, and organizing the program space.\n\nVolunteers for the collection and the summer will receive special access to our presale, slated for August 16th!\n\nMeet at Gracie's main entrance area. We will contact you if we need to provide additional information.\n\nIMPORTANT NOTE: Please sign up for desired shift before 11 AM on the desired day. Any day with no signups after 11 AM will be cancelled.\n---\nEvent Details: https://campusgroups.rit.edu/rsvp?id=2330382
END:VEVENT
